// They choose the portfolio lines shown inside each wine, as well as which wines appear.
//
// A corporate supplier’s own stock. A corporate supplier also sees its own offers, as stock_type
// supplier, and its stock on broking purchase orders, as stock_type bpo. Both are always due_in, as
// market offers show them: the stock reaches Cru only once it is sold. Neither has a cost or can be
// sold into a bid. Cru takes no commission from a supplier, and adds its margin for buyers instead,
